Author: Marcel Angelo Navarro <marcel.a.n.navarro@accenture.com>
Date:   Fri Sep 4 12:05:02 2026 +0800

    fix(ui-kits): extract shared data-card-slot and hover-query constants (SFCC-236)

    zimmProductCardShared.ts was named in the build plan (mirroring
    zimmColourSwatchGroupShared.ts) to hold the ten data-card-slot values and
    the hover-capable-pointer media query as a single source, but was never
    created — both were independently retyped across the organism recipe,
    the two producing molecules, and three test files, synchronised only by
    a "don't rename this without updating that too" comment.

    Extracts both into the new shared file and updates every producer and
    consumer to import from it. Pure relocation: every value's total
    occurrence count in the codebase is unchanged, only where each is
    defined moved from a repeated literal to one shared constant.

